import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 841 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of Cultivation-Law Technologization","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 841 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of Cultivation-Law Technologization","no":841,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Law Technologization","Cultivation Engineering","Law Engineering","Hyper-Multiverse Applications"],"related":["10-Three-Hundred Origin Cultivation-Systems Overview","11-Deduction-Iteration System Detailed","62-Spatial-Law Technical Implementation","757-New-Law Deduction and Anchoring"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0841_模块4-超脱者与科技-法则技术化应用.md","filePath":"en/0841_模块4-超脱者与科技-法则技术化应用.md"}'),o={name:"en/0841_模块4-超脱者与科技-法则技术化应用.md"};function r(l,e,s,c,h,u){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-841-transcended-ones-and-technology-hyper-multiverse-applications-of-cultivation-law-technologization" tabindex="-1">Entry 841 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of Cultivation-Law Technologization <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-841-transcended-ones-and-technology-hyper-multiverse-applications-of-cultivation-law-technologization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 841 | Transcended Ones and Technology | Hyper-Multiverse Applications of Cultivation-Law Technologization&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 10, 11, 62, 757</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-turning-i-comprehended-it-into-i-built-it" tabindex="-1">Introduction: turning &quot;I comprehended it&quot; into &quot;I built it&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-turning-i-comprehended-it-into-i-built-it" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: turning &quot;I comprehended it&quot; into &quot;I built it&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s cultivation laws are &quot;comprehended.&quot; A genius in closed-door cultivation for a century suddenly &quot;comprehends&quot; a move; others cannot imitate it; he himself cannot say why. Heng Yuan Zhou completely rewrites this into &quot;built&quot;: laws are no longer mysterious objects only to be suddenly enlightened upon, but engineering objects that may be scanned, encoded, anchored, copied. This is <strong>cultivation-law technologization.</strong> This entry explains: how the transcended one step-by-step technologizes the nine-realm cultivation laws, and pushes this technology from the mortal scale all the way to the hyper-multiverse scale.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally fulfill <strong>the law-first axiom</strong>: laws are the cosmos&#39; underlying code; technologization only reads and uses them, never allows tampering for plot convenience; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires technologized laws be open at all levels; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires technologization serve all beings; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires technologization lift Myriad Ranks higher; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires law engineering proceed under supervision, not disturb existing causality.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-law-technologization-s-four-steps" tabindex="-1">I. Law Technologization&#39;s Four Steps <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-law-technologization-s-four-steps" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Law Technologization&#39;s Four Steps&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Document 62 Spatial-Law Technical Implementation and Document 10 Three-Hundred Origin Cultivation-Systems Overview reveal: any one cultivation law may walk through technologization&#39;s four steps:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Step</th><th>What Is Done</th><th>Output</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Scan</td><td>Use sensory arrays to full-dimension scan the law&#39;s structure, parameters, boundaries</td><td>Law data</td></tr><tr><td>Encode</td><td>Encode massive law information into a transmittable, verifiable law data packet</td><td>Law program</td></tr><tr><td>Anchor</td><td>Fix the law program in the anchor network as a callable standard interface</td><td>Law interface</td></tr><tr><td>Reuse</td><td>All beings call through the interface, no need to each re-comprehend</td><td>Public capability</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Four steps walked, &quot;I comprehended it&quot; becomes &quot;I built it.&quot; The three-hundred Origin cultivation systems&#39; ability to open at all levels relies on this technologization — otherwise each set would rely on master-apprentice oral transmission, simply unable to popularize.</p><h2 id="ii-hyper-multiverse-applications-from-mortal-to-balanced-anchor-hyper-multiverse-realm" tabindex="-1">II. Hyper-Multiverse Applications: From Mortal to Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-hyper-multiverse-applications-from-mortal-to-balanced-anchor-hyper-multiverse-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Hyper-Multiverse Applications: From Mortal to Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law technologization&#39;s power scales up with magnitude. At the mortal scale, it lets a human youth call a basic breathing method free; at the hyper-multiverse scale, it lets the transcended one directly operate the law network itself:</p><ul><li><strong>Law-level deduction</strong>: use the Multiplication Fruit deduction engine, decomposing a new law into a hundred parallel paths simultaneously verified, accelerating law discovery;</li><li><strong>Law-level weaving</strong>: in new-cosmos frontier, the transcended one directly &quot;weaves&quot; adapted physical constants and law environments (see entry 757 &quot;New-Law Deduction and Anchoring&quot;);</li><li><strong>Law-level revision</strong>: per Myriad-Rank democratic procedure, technically revise operating-law parameters (see entry 814);</li><li><strong>Law-level audit</strong>: use Alaya Network to run a &quot;setting-self-consistency&quot; audit; any law program conflicting with fundamental laws auto-alerts.</li></ul><p>The mortal scale solves &quot;every person has a path&quot;; the hyper-multiverse scale solves &quot;civilization perpetuity.&quot; Both use the same technologization method.</p><h2 id="iii-why-technologization-does-not-abolish-cultivation" tabindex="-1">III. Why Technologization Does Not &quot;Abolish Cultivation&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-technologization-does-not-abolish-cultivation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why Technologization Does Not &quot;Abolish Cultivation&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Some worry: once laws are all technologized, doesn&#39;t cultivation become pressing buttons? Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is no — technologization solves &quot;repetitive enlightenment,&quot; not &quot;creating new Dao.&quot;</p><ul><li><strong>Basic laws technologized</strong>: Sense, Condensed and other basic methods are made into public interfaces, letting Myriad Ranks not each reinvent the wheel;</li><li><strong>Frontier laws still need human enlightenment</strong>: new cosmoses, new levels, new axioms&#39; exploration still requires the transcended one to open new paths in life-death and responsibility — technology is a tool, not a substitute;</li><li><strong>Technologization makes enlightenment faster</strong>: the deduction engine compresses &quot;trial-and-error for a century&quot; to &quot;deduction for a hundred days&quot;; the enlightened devote energy to true innovation.</li></ul><p>Technologization does not eliminate cultivation, but frees cultivators from repetitive labor to do harder creation.</p><h2 id="iv-law-technologization-and-alaya-supervision" tabindex="-1">IV. Law Technologization and Alaya Supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-law-technologization-and-alaya-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Law Technologization and Alaya Supervision&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Once law programs go online, they may be abused and tampered. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s defense line:</p><ul><li>All law interfaces pass ethics review; any interface usable for predation is closed or locked;</li><li>Call records throughout leave traces; who called which law in which spacetime, applied on whom, traceable;</li><li>Law-program version management is strict — revisions follow democratic procedure, old versions archived, eliminating &quot;plot-hijacking-the-setting&quot;-style temporary tampering.</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: engineering repetitive enlightenment lets Myriad Ranks not each reinvent the wheel; freeing genius energy for true innovation</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: law interfaces open network-wide, seal the &quot;monopolizing laws&quot; predatory path; predatory interfaces all closed</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s laws rely on Gu Chensha&#39;s bestowal; others cannot use them; Heng Yuan Zhou makes laws into public interfaces; Myriad Ranks call free</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: law interfaces adapted per five lineages; carbon-based, energy, mechanical, consciousness, hybrid lineage each have calling methods</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: from basic breathing methods to new-cosmos law weaving, technical documents and interface parameters all public</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-law-interfaces-supervision-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Law Interfaces&#39; Supervision and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-law-interfaces-supervision-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Law Interfaces&#39; Supervision and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After law interfaces open, who is calling and calling for what must be seen. Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision throughout leaves traces on all law-interface calls; once predatory calls appear, immediate circuit-break. The transcended one&#39;s results in pushing law technologization are counted into civilizational weight by the breadth of Myriad-Rank coverage and safety — the more open and safer the interface, the higher the weight. This set of mechanisms ensures law technologization does not head toward &quot;convenient for strong ones to overstep,&quot; but toward &quot;convenient for Myriad Ranks to progress.&quot; The Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s ability to infinitely scale without collapsing is precisely because every new interface has passed three gates: public, supervised, metered.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultivation-law technologization is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s core leap rewriting &quot;enlightenment&quot; into &quot;engineering.&quot; It uses scan, encode, anchor, reuse four steps to turn unrepeatable sudden enlightenment into Myriad Ranks&#39; callable public interfaces; uses Alaya supervision to lock the strongest law tools within the republican framework. When cultivation is no longer a few geniuses&#39; private sudden enlightenment, but a public project Myriad Ranks jointly build, civilization truly owns an infinitely scalable evolutionary foundation that does not collapse — this is the law-first axiom&#39;s fulfillment at the technology dimension.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">Entry 10 · Three-Hundred Origin Cultivation-Systems Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/11-推演迭代体系详解.html">Entry 11 · Deduction-Iteration System Detailed</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/62-空间法理技术实现.html">Entry 62 · Spatial-Law Technical Implementation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/757_模块4-超多元级规则-新法则推演与锚定.html">Entry 757 · New-Law Deduction and Anchoring</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
